        "valueString": "Inspection normal, with no deformity or bruising. Tender over bilateral paraspinal muscles L3–L5; no midline bony tenderness. Range of motion full but uncomfortable, especially extension; pain reproducible with lumbar extension and prolonged standing. Straight-leg raise negative bilaterally."
